  "item.irineu.mapa_camara": "Map to the Chamber of the Three Powers",
  "item.irineu.profecia": "Prophecy of the Three Powers",
  "book.irineu.profecia.1": "Prophecy of the Three Powers\n\nWhen Brazil hangs by a thread, four relics, taken from four legends, will open the way to the Three Powers Square.",
  "book.irineu.profecia.2": "The Antimatter Circuit, from the Varginha E.T.: his ship crashed into a crater in the Cerrado.\n\nThe Seal of Universal Judgment, from Ednaldo Pereira: his court sits on the peaks of the Atlantic Forest.",
  "book.irineu.profecia.3": "The Primordial Blue Pen, from Manoel Gomes: call him with the totem of weight plates and blue candles.\n\nThe Descending Trapezius Dumbbell, from Kléber BamBam: he trains at the Gym.",
  "book.irineu.profecia.4": "Bring all four to the Chamber of the Three Powers, hidden beneath the Cerrado. Each on its pedestal, and the portal opens.\n\nIn the Square, the ballot box decides the nation's fate.",
  "subtitles.irineu.block.urna_eleitoral_sagrada.pirililili": "Ballot box: beep-beep-beep!",
  "dimension.brasil_mod.praca_tres_poderes": "Three Powers Square",
  "biome.brasil_mod.planalto_central": "Central Plateau",
  "block.irineu.urna_eleitoral_sagrada": "Sacred Ballot Box",
  "block.irineu.urna_eleitoral_sagrada.dica_1": "The heart of the Three Powers Square",
  "block.irineu.urna_eleitoral_sagrada.dica_2": "Vote on it and the final boss appears",
  "block.irineu.urna_eleitoral_sagrada.comecou": "Beep-beep-beep! The election has begun!",
  "block.irineu.urna_eleitoral_sagrada.em_andamento": "The election is already under way!",
  "block.irineu.urna_eleitoral_sagrada.fora": "The sacred ballot box only works in the Three Powers Square.",
  "item.irineu.urna_eletronica.so_na_praca": "The ballot box only works in the Three Powers Square!",
  "item.irineu.urna_eletronica.dica": "Only works in the Three Powers Square",
  "item.irineu.bandeira_nacional.na_praca": "The flag opens no portal here: the only way out of the Square is to win.",
  "subtitles.irineu.block.pedestal_reliquia.triunfo": "Triumphant fanfare",
  "block.irineu.pedestal_reliquia": "Relic Pedestal",
  "block.irineu.pedestal_reliquia.dica_1": "One of the 4 pedestals of the Chamber of the Three Powers",
  "block.irineu.pedestal_reliquia.dica_2": "With all 4 relics, the portal to the Square opens",
  "block.irineu.pedestal_reliquia.pede": "This pedestal asks for: %s",
  "block.irineu.pedestal_reliquia.ja_tem": "This pedestal already holds its relic: %s",
  "block.irineu.pedestal_reliquia.encaixou": "%s in place! (%s of 4)",
  "block.irineu.pedestal_reliquia.no_lugar": "%s is in place (%s of 4)",
  "block.irineu.portal_praca_tres_poderes": "Three Powers Square Portal",
  "block.irineu.portal_praca_tres_poderes.abriu": "The portal to the Three Powers Square has opened!",
  "item.irineu.ata_camara": "Minutes of the Secret Session",
  "book.irineu.ata_camara.1": "Minutes of the Secret Session\n\nBeneath the red earth of the Cerrado, far from the people's eyes, the Three Powers raised this Chamber to guard the way to the Square.",
  "book.irineu.ata_camara.2": "Four pedestals ring the well, each bearing the name of its relic: the Circuit, the Seal, the Pen and the Dumbbell. The wrong relic, the pedestal refuses.",
  "book.irineu.ata_camara.3": "With all four in place, the well lights up in green and yellow. Whoever crosses it reaches the Square, where the ballot box awaits the final vote.\n\nThere being no further business, the session was closed.",
  "advancements.irineu.reliquias.varginha.title": "They Walk Among Us",
  "advancements.irineu.reliquias.varginha.description": "Get the Antimatter Circuit from the Varginha E.T.",
  "advancements.irineu.reliquias.ednaldo.title": "Worth Nothing, Worth Everything",
  "advancements.irineu.reliquias.ednaldo.description": "Get the Seal of Universal Judgment from Ednaldo Pereira",
  "advancements.irineu.reliquias.manoel.title": "Blue Pen, Pen So Blue",
  "advancements.irineu.reliquias.manoel.description": "Get the Primordial Blue Pen from Manoel Gomes",
  "advancements.irineu.reliquias.bambam.title": "Birl! Descending Trapezius",
  "advancements.irineu.reliquias.bambam.description": "Get the Descending Trapezius Dumbbell from Kléber BamBam",
  "advancements.irineu.raiz.title": "The Journey Across Brazil",
  "advancements.irineu.raiz.description": "Enter Brazil through the National Flag portal",
  "advancements.irineu.entrou_na_praca.title": "The Square Belongs to the People",
  "advancements.irineu.entrou_na_praca.description": "With the 4 relics on their pedestals, cross the Chamber portal into the Three Powers Square",
  "advancements.irineu.salvou_o_brasil.title": "Order and Progress: You Saved the Country!",
  "advancements.irineu.salvou_o_brasil.description": "Defeat the Lulonaro in the Three Powers Square",
  "item.irineu.faixa_presidencial_suprema": "Supreme Presidential Sash",
